From 102cacf461f882f3bf71f91974815d597b1b201d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yannick Serafini <yannick.serafini@wifx.net>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 11:55:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] mc610: add +GTCCINFO? cell info parser, wiring and
 tests

Implement get_cell_info() for the MC610 by querying +GTCCINFO?
and parsing its GSM/LTE serving and neighbor cell sections into
MMCellInfo objects.

- Field layouts follow the Fibocom AT Commands User Manual V3.0,
  section 9.12; hex vs decimal fields are documented inline.
- Empty neighbor sections are reported by the module as an
  all-zeros placeholder entry (<rat> = 0); these are ignored.
- Add unit tests covering LTE serving/neighbor, GSM, leading
  zeros, the empty-neighbor placeholder, and malformed input.
- Split the helpers into a separate meson target so they can be
  linked into the new test binary.

Signed-off-by: Yannick Serafini <yannick.serafini@wifx.net>
